{"slug":"greetings-starter-l12","artistFeel":"Usher","beat":"Party Upbeat","data":{"title":"Greetings & Conversation — Starter · Lesson 12","subject":"greetings","subjectLabel":"Greetings & Conversation","level":"starter","lesson":12,"totalLessons":20,"genre":"R&B","lyrics":"[Ad-lib]\nHey, let's go!\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nLet's explore… Vamos a explorar\nTurn the corner… Damos la vuelta\nFeel the rhythm of the city streets.\n\n[Verse]\nSun's up, let's begin,\nlearning words, let the journey spin.\nGreeting… Saludo\nSmile and say.\nNice to meet you… Encantado\nThat's how we start the day.\nIntroduce… Presenta\nYour name today.\nName… Nombre\nThat's what they say.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nLet's explore… Vamos a explorar\nTurn the corner… Damos la vuelta\nFeel the rhythm of the city streets.\n\n[Verse]\nWho?… ¿Quién?\nWhat?… ¿Qué?\nWhen?… ¿Cuándo?\nQuestions in the air.\nWhere?… ¿Dónde?\nWhy?… ¿Por qué?\nHow many?… ¿Cuántos?\nCurious everywhere.\nThank you… Gracias\nFor the guidance you give.\nYou're welcome… De nada\nIn this city where we live.\n\n[Bridge]\nWalking through the plaza, colors so bright,\nevery corner's a story, every face a new sight.\nHola, hola, echoes in the square,\nconversation flowing like a melody in the air.\n\n[Hook]","vocab":[{"es":"saludo","en":"greeting"},{"es":"encantado","en":"nice to meet you"},{"es":"presenta","en":"introduce"},{"es":"nombre","en":"name"},{"es":"¿quién?","en":"who?"},{"es":"¿qué?","en":"what?"},{"es":"¿cuándo?","en":"when?"},{"es":"¿dónde?","en":"where?"},{"es":"¿por qué?","en":"why?"},{"es":"¿cuántos?","en":"how many?"},{"es":"¿cuál?","en":"which?"},{"es":"¿cómo?","en":"how?"},{"es":"bien","en":"well"},{"es":"vale","en":"okay"},{"es":"¿vale?","en":"okay?"}]},"timings":[{"start":0.4,"end":2.1,"loss":3.82664118267241},{"start":2.1,"end":3.56,"loss":6.407715797424316},{"start":3.56,"end":7.57,"loss":2.7511526859167854},{"start":7.57,"end":10.26,"loss":2.44432673887773